  <title>【19题系列】 Question 1</title>
  <dc:creator>江鸟吟风 </dc:creator>
  <link>https://your-website-url.example.com/posts/M-1/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<section id="题目" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="题目">题目</h2>
<p>单位圆内有两条不重合的平行弦 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?AB">、<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?CD">，其所在直线的距离为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?d">。两弦将圆分成三个区域；沿从 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?AB"> 到 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?CD"> 的方向，三个区域的面积依次为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?S_1,S_2,S_3">，且它们成公比为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q">（<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q%5Cge1">）的等比数列。</p>
<p>（1）用含 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q"> 的式子分别表示 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?S_1,S_2,S_3">；</p>
<p>（2）若 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5Cdfrac%7B%7CCD%7C%5E3%7D%7B%7CAB%7C%5E3%7D=q%5E2">，求 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q"> 的值；</p>
<p>（3）记 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?d"> 的最大值为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?D">，证明：<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?2%5Csin%5Cdfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D%3CD%3C2%5Ctan%5Cdfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D">。</p>
</section>
<section id="解答" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="解答">解答</h2>
<div class="callout callout-style-default callout-note no-icon callout-titled" title="点击展开 / 收起解答">
<div class="callout-header d-flex align-content-center collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target=".callout-1-contents" aria-controls="callout-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle callout">
<div class="callout-icon-container">
<i class="callout-icon no-icon"></i>
</div>
<div class="callout-title-container flex-fill">
<span class="screen-reader-only">注记</span>点击展开 / 收起解答
</div>
<div class="callout-btn-toggle d-inline-block border-0 py-1 ps-1 pe-0 float-end"><i class="callout-toggle"></i></div>
</div>
<div id="callout-1" class="callout-1-contents callout-collapse collapse">
<div class="callout-body-container callout-body">
<section id="三部分面积" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="三部分面积">（1）三部分面积</h3>
<p>由单位圆的面积为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5Cpi">，且</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AS_1:S_2:S_3=1:q:q%5E2,%0A"></p>
<p>得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cboxed%7B%0AS_1=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B1+q+q%5E2%7D,%5Cqquad%0AS_2=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%20q%7D%7B1+q+q%5E2%7D,%5Cqquad%0AS_3=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%20q%5E2%7D%7B1+q+q%5E2%7D%0A%7D.%0A"></p>
</section>
<section id="确定公比" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="确定公比">（2）确定公比</h3>
<p>令</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA(x)=x-%5Csin%20x%5Ccos%20x,%5Cqquad%200%3Cx%3C%5Cpi.%0A"></p>
<p>圆心角为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?2x"> 的弓形，其面积为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A(x)">，对应弦长为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?2%5Csin%20x">。这里圆心角按弓形所在一侧的弧取值，允许大于 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5Cpi">。</p>
<p>设面积为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?S_1,S_3"> 的两个外侧弓形，所对应的圆心角分别为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?2%5Ctheta,2%5Cphi">，则</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AS_1=A(%5Ctheta),%5Cqquad%20S_3=A(%5Cphi),%0A"></p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%7CAB%7C=2%5Csin%5Ctheta,%5Cqquad%20%7CCD%7C=2%5Csin%5Cphi.%0A"></p>
<p>由（1）及本问条件，</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA(%5Cphi)=q%5E2A(%5Ctheta),%5Cqquad%0A%5Csin%5E3%5Cphi=q%5E2%5Csin%5E3%5Ctheta.%0A"></p>
<p>因此</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7BA(%5Ctheta)%7D%7B%5Csin%5E3%5Ctheta%7D%0A=%0A%5Cfrac%7BA(%5Cphi)%7D%7B%5Csin%5E3%5Cphi%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B1%7D%0A"></p>
<p>下面证明函数</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AF(x)=%5Cfrac%7BA(x)%7D%7B%5Csin%5E3x%7D%0A"></p>
<p>在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?(0,%5Cpi)"> 上严格递增。</p>
<p>由</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA'(x)=2%5Csin%5E2x%3E0,%5Cqquad%20A(0)=0,%0A"></p>
<p>可知 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A(x)%3E0">（<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?0%3Cx%3C%5Cpi">）。求导得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AF'(x)%0A=%0A%5Cfrac%7B3%5Csin%20x-%5Csin%5E3x-3x%5Ccos%20x%7D%7B%5Csin%5E4x%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>令</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AH(x)=3%5Csin%20x-%5Csin%5E3x-3x%5Ccos%20x,%0A"></p>
<p>则</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%0AH'(x)%0A&amp;=3x%5Csin%20x-3%5Csin%5E2x%5Ccos%20x%5C%5C%0A&amp;=3%5Csin%20x%5Cbigl(x-%5Csin%20x%5Ccos%20x%5Cbigr)%5C%5C%0A&amp;=3%5Csin%20x%5C,A(x)%3E0%0A%5Cqquad(0%3Cx%3C%5Cpi).%0A%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%0A"></p>
<p>又 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?H(0)=0">，故 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?H(x)%3E0">，从而</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AF'(x)%3E0.%0A"></p>
<p>由式（1）及 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?F"> 的严格单调性，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Ctheta=%5Cphi,%0A"></p>
<p>于是 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?S_1=S_3">。结合第（1）问的结果及 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q%5Cge1">，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Aq%5E2=1,%5Cqquad%20%5Cboxed%7Bq=1%7D.%0A"></p>
</section>
<section id="最大距离及其范围" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="最大距离及其范围">（3）最大距离及其范围</h3>
<p>因为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A"> 在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?(0,%5Cpi)"> 上严格递增，且</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Clim_%7Bx%5Cto0%5E+%7DA(x)=0,%5Cqquad%0A%5Clim_%7Bx%5Cto%5Cpi%5E-%7DA(x)=%5Cpi,%0A"></p>
<p>所以对每个 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q%5Cge1">，可分别定义唯一的 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?f(q),g(q)%5Cin(0,%5Cpi)">，使</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA(f(q))=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B1+q+q%5E2%7D,%0A%5Cqquad%0AA(g(q))=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%20q%5E2%7D%7B1+q+q%5E2%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B2%7D%0A"></p>
<p>取垂直于两弦、过圆心的坐标轴，以从 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?AB"> 到 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?CD"> 的方向为正方向，则两弦所在直线的坐标分别为</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A-%5Ccos%20f(q),%5Cqquad%20%5Ccos%20g(q).%0A"></p>
<p>于是</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ad(q)=%5Ccos%20f(q)+%5Ccos%20g(q).%20%5Ctag%7B3%7D%0A"></p>
<p><strong>① 确定最大值取得的位置。</strong></p>
<p>当 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q%3E1"> 时，由式（2）及 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A"> 严格递增，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Af(q)%3Cg(q).%0A"></p>
<p>利用第（2）问中已证的 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?F"> 严格递增，有</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7BA(g(q))%7D%7B%5Csin%5E3g(q)%7D%0A%3E%0A%5Cfrac%7BA(f(q))%7D%7B%5Csin%5E3f(q)%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>又</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA(g(q))=q%5E2A(f(q)),%0A"></p>
<p>所以</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7B%5Csin%20g(q)%7D%7B%5Csin%20f(q)%7D%3Cq%5E%7B2/3%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B4%7D%0A"></p>
<p>由于</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Aq%5E%7B1/3%7D(q+2)-(2q+1)%0A=(q%5E%7B1/3%7D-1)%5E3(q%5E%7B1/3%7D+1)%3E0,%0A"></p>
<p>故</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Aq%5E%7B2/3%7D%3C%5Cfrac%7Bq(q+2)%7D%7B2q+1%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>结合式（4），得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7B%5Csin%20g(q)%7D%7B%5Csin%20f(q)%7D%0A%3C%0A%5Cfrac%7Bq(q+2)%7D%7B2q+1%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B5%7D%0A"></p>
<p>对式（2）中的两式分别关于 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q"> 求导，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A2%5Csin%5E2f(q)%5C,f'(q)%0A=-%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi(1+2q)%7D%7B(1+q+q%5E2)%5E2%7D,%0A"></p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A2%5Csin%5E2g(q)%5C,g'(q)%0A=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%20q(q+2)%7D%7B(1+q+q%5E2)%5E2%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>因此</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%0Ad'(q)%0A&amp;=-%5Csin%20f(q)%5C,f'(q)-%5Csin%20g(q)%5C,g'(q)%5C%5C%0A&amp;=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B2(1+q+q%5E2)%5E2%7D%0A%5Cleft(%0A%5Cfrac%7B1+2q%7D%7B%5Csin%20f(q)%7D%0A-%5Cfrac%7Bq(q+2)%7D%7B%5Csin%20g(q)%7D%0A%5Cright).%0A%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%0A"></p>
<p>由式（5）知</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ad'(q)%3C0%5Cqquad(q%3E1).%0A"></p>
<p>故 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?d(q)"> 在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5B1,+%5Cinfty)"> 上严格递减，最大值在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?q=1"> 时取得。</p>
<p>此时 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?S_1=S_3=%5Cpi/3">，故 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?f(1)=g(1)">。记这一固定角为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5Ctheta_0">，则</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA(%5Ctheta_0)=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D,%0A%5Cqquad%0A%5Cboxed%7BD=2%5Ccos%5Ctheta_0%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B6%7D%0A"></p>
<p><strong>② 证明下界。</strong></p>
<p>因为</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA%5Cleft(%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D%5Cright)%0A=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D-%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt3%7D%7B4%7D%0A%3C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D,%0A"></p>
<p>且</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AA%5Cleft(%5Cfrac%7B5%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D%5Cright)%0A=%5Cfrac%7B5%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D-%5Cfrac14%0A=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D+%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi-3%7D%7B12%7D%0A%3E%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D,%0A"></p>
<p>由 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A"> 严格递增，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D%3C%5Ctheta_0%3C%5Cfrac%7B5%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>因此</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cboxed%7B%0AD=2%5Ccos%5Ctheta_0%0A%3E2%5Ccos%5Cfrac%7B5%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D%0A=2%5Csin%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D%0A%7D.%20%5Ctag%7B7%7D%0A"></p>
<p><strong>③ 证明上界。</strong></p>
<p>令</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ax_0=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7D-%5Ctheta_0,%0A"></p>
<p>则</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A0%3Cx_0%3C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B6%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>由式（6），</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7D-x_0-%5Csin%20x_0%5Ccos%20x_0%0A=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B3%7D,%0A"></p>
<p>即</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ax_0+%5Csin%20x_0%5Ccos%20x_0=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B6%7D,%0A%5Cqquad%0AD=2%5Csin%20x_0.%20%5Ctag%7B8%7D%0A"></p>
<p>对任意 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?x%5Cin%5B0,%5Cpi/6%5D">，定义 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?h(x)"> 为满足</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Ctan%20h(x)=%5Csin%20x,%5Cqquad%0A0%5Cle%20h(x)%3C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B2%7D%0A"></p>
<p>的唯一角。由定义求导，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cbigl(1+%5Ctan%5E2h(x)%5Cbigr)h'(x)=%5Ccos%20x,%0A"></p>
<p>所以</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ah'(x)=%5Cfrac%7B%5Ccos%20x%7D%7B1+%5Csin%5E2x%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>令</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AJ(x)=x+%5Csin%20x%5Ccos%20x-2h(x),%0A"></p>
<p>则</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%0AJ'(x)%0A&amp;=2%5Ccos%5E2x-%5Cfrac%7B2%5Ccos%20x%7D%7B1+%5Csin%5E2x%7D%5C%5C%0A&amp;=%5Cfrac%7B%0A2%5Ccos%20x(1-%5Ccos%20x)(%5Ccos%5E2x+%5Ccos%20x-1)%0A%7D%7B1+%5Csin%5E2x%7D.%0A%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%0A"></p>
<p>当 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?0%3Cx%3C%5Cpi/6"> 时，</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Ccos%20x%3E%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt3%7D%7B2%7D,%0A"></p>
<p>故</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Ccos%5E2x+%5Ccos%20x-1%0A%3E%5Cfrac34+%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt3%7D%7B2%7D-1%3E0.%0A"></p>
<p>因此</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AJ'(x)%3E0%5Cqquad%5Cleft(0%3Cx%3C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B6%7D%5Cright).%0A"></p>
<p>又 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?h(0)=0">，从而 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?J(0)=0">，故</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0AJ(x_0)%3E0.%0A"></p>
<p>结合式（8），得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A2h(x_0)%0A%3Cx_0+%5Csin%20x_0%5Ccos%20x_0%0A=%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B6%7D,%0A"></p>
<p>即</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ah(x_0)%3C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>由正切函数在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5B0,%5Cpi/2)"> 上严格递增，得</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Csin%20x_0%0A=%5Ctan%20h(x_0)%0A%3C%5Ctan%5Cfrac%7B%5Cpi%7D%7B12%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>因此</p>
